  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Located at 909 chemin de Font de Currault, on the edge of the Parc de la Valmasque, the Club Canin Mouginois offers dog training, agility and hoopers classes.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The club's website is no longer accessible, and we found no recent official page publishing its times or prices. The club is nevertheless still active: it gave an obedience demonstration at the "L'animal, moi &amp; Cie" day organised by the city of Mougins at the Eco'Parc in October 2024 (programme on mougins.fr). Check with the club or the town hall (04 92 92 50 00) before visiting to find out class days and enrolment conditions.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: the Parc de la Valmasque right next door lets you extend the outing with a walk in the forest.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Parc de la Valmasque, with its riding centre and trails, is directly accessible from the club.</p>
